      "created_at": "2011-10-12T22:46:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://idle.slashdot.org/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n      <a href=\"https://idle.slashdot.org/story/11/10/12/1216258/real-life-super-hero-arrested\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">idle.slashdot.org</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:130/97;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/909f5155b7a5aa4fa991be4ce3d9b730e14d0bb7.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"130\" height=\"97\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://idle.slashdot.org/story/11/10/12/1216258/real-life-super-hero-arrested\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Real Life Super Hero Arrested - Slashdot</a></h3>\n\n<p>First time accepted submitter Pat Attack writes \"In an ironic twist of fate, Phoenix Jones, a self-styled super hero from Seattle, has landed in jail. Jones happened upon a group of people fighting in the street and tried to stop the fight using...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
