      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-10-12T23:35:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have such mixed feelings about this! I see the bravery and good will that this guy has shown (and it sounds like he’s actually really helped some folks), but at the same time, I live in a democratic society with a social contract and this guy is clearly not living up to his end of that contract (neither are the guys whose fight he broke up, but two wrongs=/=a right and all…).</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:57:18.372Z",
