      "created_at": "2011-10-13T11:53:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It seems like the police are often misquoted regarding these guys, and that there’s a great deal of irritation on the part of the Seattle Police Department. Not to mention there’s at least one of these: <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/public/Obsidian-Revenant\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">www.facebook.com/public/Obsidian-Revenant</a> How many more “villains” do you think are as a result of this costumed vigilantism?</p>\n<p>Edit: Not sure if that link worked right, I can’t view facebook at work.</p>",
